    "0899728420a5d2d9cacd30ffc9ec36c50f456b1e": {
      "message": "docs: sync the plugin docs with the released behaviour\n\nThe dsh-git README already described 0.5.0, but its install note still\nsaid \"once published to npm\"; this release makes that sentence true, so\nit changes here.\n\ndsh-context7: the index.js header carried an older measurement (5,900\ncalls at 0.3%) than both READMEs (5,527 at 0.33%), the verification note\nnamed only 0.2.1-rc.5 although the running desktop runtime is 0.2.2-rc.1\n(where both tools and the guidance section are visible), and\nfailOnStartupError read as if `true` were the DSH default when it is this\nbundle that sets it. The manifest moves to 0.2.1 so the corrected README\nreaches npm.\n\nThe root README's install pins move to the versions being released.",
      "author": {
